## Task 2 — Save to Watchlist button on stock detail page
In app/stocks/[ticker]/page.tsx wire up the "Save to Watchlist" button:
- On click open an inline dropdown with three options:
  "Watchlist" | "Researching" | "Invested"
- On selection POST to /api/watchlist with ticker, company_name, 
  logo_url, sector, status, and session_id from getSessionId()
- Show loading state on button while request is in flight
- After success show current status label on button (e.g. "Researching ✓")
- On page load fetch GET /api/watchlist?session_id={id} and check if 
  this ticker is already saved — if so show current status pre-selected
- Do not change any existing page styles

