## Task 3 — Watchlist page
Create app/watchlist/page.tsx:
- Fetch user's watchlist via GET /api/watchlist?session_id={getSessionId()}
- Display three tabs: Watchlist | Researching | Invested
- Each tab shows a grid of stock cards matching that status
- Each card shows: ticker (bold), company name, sector, status badge
- Each card has two actions:
  - Status dropdown to move stock to different status (calls PATCH)
  - Remove button (calls DELETE) with a confirmation step
- Empty state: if a tab has no stocks show a friendly message and a 
  link back to / to discover stocks
- Loading state: show skeleton while fetching
- Do not change existing app colors or styles

